                    "line": 15,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Can you provide a example(s) of configurations using the newly added properties.\n\nSeen your stacked change https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/86157/3\n\nbut it does not require `PLDMSensors` property. So i am wondering why we are adding it if there is no config which needs that change."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 15,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "PeterYinGit",
                        "email": "peter.yin@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "PeterYinGit"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                },
                {
                    "file": "schemas/mctp.json",
                    "line": 14,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Let's make `Inventory` a required property to align with DBus design guidelines.\n\nWe can just leave it empty in case there is no inventory name."
                },
                {
                    "file": "schemas/mctp.json",
                    "line": 14,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "PeterYinGit",
                        "email": "peter.yin@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "PeterYinGit"
                    },
                    "message": "Inventory name is not necessary. If we don\u2019t add it, the system will use the terminus name as the inventory name in PLDMD."
                },
                {
                    "file": "schemas/mctp.json",
                    "line": 55,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Let's make `Inventory` a required property to align with DBus design guidelines.\n\nWe can just leave it empty in case there is no inventory name."
                }
            ],
